# #190: Medivh (a) dashes to about x 120, then EX Vanishing Act blinks through Medivh (b) standing at x 240.
# Melee preset: LB held with B casts the EX special; the setup fills both bars, since an EX costs a third of one.
#! chat -dev setup quick hero medivh;meter 100
#! preset melee
540 a stick 1 0
548 a stick 0 0
600 a stick 1 0
600 a press LB
600 a tap B 2
602 a stick 0 0
602 a release LB
610 a capture
680 a press VIEW
750 a release VIEW
# The cast starts on the press; on its frame 11 the pass hits b once, on the ground, and launches it upward.
#! expect a 600 special 14 form 0
#! expect a 600 special EX 14
#! absent b 540-608 damage
#! expect b 609-611 damage 8.219
#! expect b 609-611 launch up 1 from-air 0
#! absent b 612-680 damage
